'''Blood Ritual''' is a debuff from the clone of [[Kadaris, Crimson Mayor]].

The debuff use a generic skull icon that shared with a lots of debuffs. Blood Ritual itself deals physical damage over time. Since it is NOT {{stl|Bleed}} or {{stl|Corrupted Blood}}, the debuff cannot be removed by flask mod or mod that prevent corrupted blood. Player need to kill the boss and the clone quickly and /or not step on the ground effect to prevent take too much DOT. Alternatively, life recovery and physical [[damage taken as]], may able to migrate the DOT from this debuff. 

